an class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code>(10<sup>30</sup>)<sup id=\"cite_ref-too_large_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-too_large-2\">[2]</a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-too_small-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_small_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_small_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_small_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_small_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">These typedefs are only declared if <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\">std::intmax_t</a></span> can represent the denominator.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-too_large-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_large_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_large_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_large_2-2\">2.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-too_large_2-3\">2.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">These typedefs are only declared if <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integer\">std::intmax_t</a></span> can represent the numerator.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"Compile-time_rational_arithmetic\">Compile-time rational arithmetic</h3>\n<p>Several alias templates, that perform arithmetic operations on <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time are provided.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ratio\">&lt;ratio&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio_add\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ratio_add</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> adds two <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(alias template)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio_subtract\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ratio_subtract</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> subtracts two <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(alias template)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio_multiply\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ratio_multiply</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> multiplies two <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(alias template)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio_divide\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ratio_divide</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> divides two <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(alias template)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Compile-time_rational_comparison\">Compile-time rational comparison</h3>\n<p>Several class templates, that perform comparison operations on <code>ratio</code> objects at compile-time are provided.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ratio\">&lt;ratio&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio_equal\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ratio_equal</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>